Scope of the MIT grant above
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above applies ONLY to software files newly authored by
Dan Meany for this local build, and to specific small modifications listed
below. Everything else — the vast majority of the codebase, the text
corpora, the dictionaries, and the commentaries — remains under its
original upstream license and copyright and is NOT relicensed by this file.
Documentation is covered separately by section 2.

NOTE ON PATHS: the vendored application tree was resynced against upstream
`dev` on 2026-08-10 and now lives at `scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/`
(previously `.../scaife-viewer-2026-03-27-001/`). Paths below reflect the
current tree.

Newly authored SOFTWARE files covered by the MIT grant above:
  - .gitignore
  - .gitattributes
  - bootstrap.sh
  - scripts/fetch-data.sh
  - scripts/run-tests.sh
  - scripts/lint.sh
  - scripts/sbom-refresh.sh
  - deps/morpheus-combined/Dockerfile
  - scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/Dockerfile-local
  - scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/deploy/entrypoint-locked.sh
