  - scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/data/content-manifests/local.yaml
  - scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/sv_pdl/localdict/**   (whole app)
  - scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/sv_pdl/localcomm/**   (whole app)
  - scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/sv_pdl/tests/**       (whole test suite)
  - scaife/scaife-viewer-2026-08-10-001/sv_pdl/openapi_spec.py
