  (The two templates are listed as software because they are Django
  templates that are part of the running application. The prose *content*
  of licenses.html is additionally available under CC BY 4.0 per section 2,
  so it can be quoted or reused as documentation.)

No longer claimed (upstream now provides these; the local versions were
retired at the 2026-08-10 resync):
  - sv_pdl/templates/reader/reader.html    upstream added this file, and
                                           removed the polyfill.io script
                                           the local override existed to
                                           replace. Now upstream's, unmodified.

Small modifications (still Perseus-derived; the MIT grant covers only the
lines actually added or changed by Dan Meany, not the surrounding code):
  - sv_pdl/settings.py                    (added STATICFILES_DIRS entry,
                                           localdict + localcomm apps)
  - sv_pdl/urls.py                        (URL routes for new views)
  - sv_pdl/views.py                       (morpheus_local, openapi_json,
                                           swagger_ui, licenses views;
                                           removed dead-code proxies)
  - sv_pdl/templates/site_base.html       (swapped 2 CDN <script> tags
                                           for local static; added
                                           {% load static %})
  - sv_pdl/templates/homepage.html        (added footer link block)
  - sv_pdl/context_processors.py          (removed hardcoded Perseus
                                           Google Analytics IDs)
  - deploy/docker-compose.yml             (SCAIFE_BIND env for ports)
  - deploy/entrypoint.sh                  (dictionary + commentary ingest
                                           steps; SV_INDEXER_LIMIT /
                                           SV_INDEXER_MAX_WORKERS; skips
                                           the repo-metadata step that
                                           calls api.github.com)
  - Dockerfile                            (lint opt-in behind RUN_LINT;
                                           urllib3, gunicorn, certifi
                                           pinned to patched releases;
                                           python 3.8 -> 3.9 base;
                                           setuptools==81.0)
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/WidgetTokenList.vue
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/WidgetWordList.vue
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/NewAlexandriaWidget.vue

  No longer modified (upstream's version is used as-is since 2026-08-10):
  - sv_pdl/templates/app.html             (upstream removed the polyfill)
  - static/src/js/reader/widgets/WidgetPerseusDictionary.vue
                                          (upstream rewrote it; the local
                                           API now emits the shape it
                                           expects instead)

Downloaded third-party assets under `static/vendor/`:
  - jquery.min.js                                       (jQuery — MIT)
  - swagger-ui/*                                        (Apache 2.0)
NOT covered by the MIT grant above — see each upstream project.
(polyfill.min.js was removed at the 2026-08-10 resync — upstream no longer
loads an IntersectionObserver polyfill, so the local copy was orphaned.)

